{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出小\n無量壽經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "功德文如此經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "神力傳在藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作那"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有楞伽經蒙授\n記之文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐傳一釋教錄六等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《釋論》不流布漢土，出通法疏一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摩多者《釋論》譯者也，《釋論》本文者《起\n信論》也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依華嚴一經，上本經有十箇三千大千世界微塵數偈、一四天下微塵數品，中本經\n有四十九萬八千八百偈、一千二百品，下本經有十萬偈、四十八品，略本經即今本，部八十卷等也，出《行\n願品疏鈔》三卷"}
